  "name": "Draft Conversion Practices Bill (Joint Committee)",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Joint Committee has been appointed to consider and report on the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/draft-conversion-practices-bill/conversion-practices-draft-bill\">Government's draft Conversion Practices Bil</a>l which sets out provisions to prevent and criminalise abusive and harmful conversion practices.</p>\r\n<p>The Joint Committee on the draft Conversion Practices Bill has been established&nbsp;by the House of Lords and the House of Commons.</p>\r\n<p>The Committee is required to report by 22 January 2027. Further details on the Committee’s work will follow in due course.</p>",
